            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"Published by the Stanford University Libraries in conjunction with the exhibition Movements for Change: The Bob Fitch Photography Archive at Stanford, Peterson Gallery & Munger Rotunda, Cecil H. Green Library, Stanford University, September 14, 2014 through January 19, 2015.\"--Title page verso.",
