            "value": "\"Designed and typset by Becky Fischbach in Sumner Stone's Cycles family of types and Arepo titling. Printed by Puritan Capital, Hollis, New Hampshire, and bound by New Hampshire Bindery. Edition 1,000 copies.\"--Title page verso.",
